  "notes": "Security and interoperability enhancement shipped in Chrome 148 across all platforms. Enforces IDNA2008 ContextJ rules (CheckJoiners flag in WHATWG URL via ICU UIDNA_CHECK_CONTEXTJ), disallowing invalid ZWNJ (U+200C) and ZWJ (U+200D) characters in domain labels and fixing over 200 WPT tests."
